Route create_ai_run:
- create a run record
- return cached results immediately when strong cache applies
- otherwise execute non-stream runs inline or queue stream runs in background

Route clear_debug_llm_log:
- allow local/debug tooling to clear the append-only LLM debug log file
- reject the route when backend DEBUG_LLM logging is disabled
- return whether the file existed plus how many bytes were removed

Route get_ai_run:
- fetch final run metadata/result with owner checks for user-bound runs

Route stream_ai_run_events:
- expose SSE events for long-text run types only
